        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required when shifting household goods by truck from Line?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">When moving household items from Line, Packers And Movers In Line typically request a valid government‑issued ID, the original GST invoice for the move, a signed service agreement, and a copy of the e‑Way bill. For rented properties, a no‑objection certificate from the landlord may also be needed to ensure smooth transit and compliance with local regulations.</p>
