        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 100% insurance coverage guarantees that the declared value of every item, including delicate glassware or electronics, is fully protected. Packers And Movers In Line partners with an IRDAI‑approved insurer, providing a seamless claim process: document the damage, submit the claim within 30 days, and receive reimbursement up to the insured amount without hidden deductions.</p>
